<title>USA: Greater Community issues trust preferred.</title>
<headline>Greater Community issues trust preferred.</headline>
<dateline>TOTOWA, N.J. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greater Community Bancorp said Wednesday it issued $20 million of trust preferred securities with an annual dividend rate of 10 percent.</p>
<p>The company said the move was made through its newly formed subsidiary GCB Capital Trust.</p>
<p>The company said the capital raised will be used to fund future growth.</p>
<p>Greater Community Bancorp is a bank holding company.</p>
</text>
